Subject: [PATCH] avcodec/v4l2_m2m: sequence initial metadata and preserve I/O failures

Base: FFmpeg n9.0.2 after preserve-start-errors and upstream-buffer-drc.
Wait for initial source metadata, keep feeding partial headers and honor
LAST/EPIPE boundaries for every running source change. Preserve actual I/O
and STOP failures. This remains a candidate for untraced Uke validation.
License: LGPL-2.1-or-later, matching the modified upstream files.

